Changes
-------
Every upstream file this project changes carries a "Modified by AIKUSAN,
<date>" line describing the change (GPL-3.0 section 5a), except JSON files,
which cannot hold comments: package.json and prompts/manifest.json were
changed on 2026-11-06 (name, version, repository links, prompt text), as
listed in CHANGELOG.md. New files carry their own copyright header.
CHANGELOG.md lists the changes per release. The built plugin carries the
GPL and MIT notices in its header; THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md lists the
licences of the bundled third-party packages.
